  description: 'Some upgrades and technologies require advanced computing capabilities
    before they can be unlocked.


    These capabilities are tested through <color=yellow>Puzzle
    Levels</color>.


    Puzzle Levels challenge your understanding of programming
    concepts such as movement, logic, sequencing, and problem solving.


    Completing
    puzzles will unlock progression paths required to expand upgrade options and
    repair the ship.'
